# game/story/prologue.rpy:22
translate indonesian prologue_start_7b302a8b:

    # narrator "Wet clover has a very specific taste when someone shoves your chin into it."
    narrator "Rasa daun semanggi basah itu sangat khas saat ada orang yang membenamkan dagumu paksa ke tanah."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:23
translate indonesian prologue_start_6aa6ffd5:

    # narrator "Bitter. Like chewed dandelion stems and rusted chain-link fence."
    narrator "Pahit. Mirip getah batang dandelion yang terkunyah dan karat pagar kawat berduri."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:28
translate indonesian prologue_start_c1783208:

    # marcus "Hey, look at page twelve! 'Sir Valorian of the Dawn!' Did you draw yourself with abs, Sato? You can't even climb the gym rope!"
    marcus "Woy, lihat halaman dua belas! 'Sir Valorian sang Fajar!' Lu ngegambar diri lu punya abs sixpack, Sato? Manjat tali pas olahraga aja lu nggak becus!"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:30
translate indonesian prologue_start_b0d38983:

    # narrator "Laughter cracks overhead—three sixth-graders standing dry under the aluminum bleachers while October rain drips off their sneaker soles onto the back of my neck."
    narrator "Tawa mereka meledak di atas kepalaku—tiga anak kelas enam berdiri nyaman di bawah tribun aluminium, sementara air hujan Oktober menetes dari sol sepatu kets mereka ke tengkukku."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:31
translate indonesian prologue_start_4ba58c90:

    # narrator "Paper tears. A slow, deliberate {i}riiiip{/i}."
    narrator "Kertas terkoyak. Suara {i}sreeek{/i} pelan yang sengaja diulang-ulang."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:32
translate indonesian prologue_start_a4d76ad4:

    # narrator "A crayon-gold cape flutters down into a puddle beside my nose and immediately turns soggy gray."
    narrator "Jubah emas dari krayon melayang jatuh ke kubangan air di samping hidungku, lalu seketika basah kuyup dan berubah kelabu."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:34
translate indonesian prologue_start_ca24c791:

    # thought "Don't cry. If your shoulders shake, they stay another five minutes. That's the rule. Statues don't get kicked twice."
    thought "Jangan nangis. Kalau pundakmu gemetar, mereka bakal nambah lima menit lagi buat ngerjain kamu. Begitu aturannya. Patung batu nggak bakal ditendang dua kali."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:36
translate indonesian prologue_start_2faf031e:

    # marcus "C'mon, leave it. My mom's picking us up. Later, 'Sir Valorian.'"
    marcus "Udah ah, tinggalin aja. Nyokap gua udah jemput tuh. Dah, 'Sir Valorian'!"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:38
translate indonesian prologue_start_81aab0cc:

    # narrator "Their footsteps splash away across the gravel lot. Nobody from the faculty room looks out the frosted window. Nobody ever does."
    narrator "Langkah kaki mereka menciprat menjauh melintasi halaman kerikil. Nggak ada satu pun guru yang nengok dari jendela buram ruang guru. Dari dulu juga nggak pernah ada."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:39
translate indonesian prologue_start_179b477e:

    # narrator "I stay flat in the crushed clover for another sixty seconds, counting raindrops until my breathing stops stuttering, then reach out with mud-caked fingers to rescue the torn page."
    narrator "Aku tetap terkapar di atas hamparan semanggi becek itu semenit lagi, menghitung tetes hujan sampai nafasku nggak tersengal-sengal lagi, lalu menjulurkan jari-jariku yang belepotan lumpur buat nyelametin halaman yang robek itu."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:45
translate indonesian prologue_start_e97d385a:

    # thought "Someday, a door will open. A real sword. Real monsters you're actually allowed to swing at. Someday, I'm going to become a hero."
    thought "Suatu hari nanti, bakal ada pintu yang terbuka. Pedang sungguhan. Monster sungguhan yang boleh kau tebas sesukamu. Suatu hari nanti... aku pasti bakal jadi pahlawan."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:50
translate indonesian prologue_start_ef0dd4a3:

    # thought "Heroes in books always know when an ambush is coming. Until I'm brave, I'll settle for noticing everything first."
    thought "Pahlawan di buku cerita selalu tahu kalau mau disergap. Sebelum aku beneran jadi berani, minimal aku harus bisa peka dan sadar duluan."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:55
translate indonesian prologue_start_66e265e8:

    # thought "If a hero ever showed up here, they wouldn't just beat up Marcus. They'd sit down first and ask if your lip was bleeding."
    thought "Kalau pahlawan sungguhan datang ke sini, dia nggak bakal cuma ngehajar Marcus. Dia bakal duduk di sebelahku dulu, lalu nanya apakah bibirku berdarah."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:71
translate indonesian prologue_start_b07bd37d:

    # narrator "Seventeen years later, the golden portal still hasn't opened."
    narrator "Tujuh belas tahun berlalu, portal keemasan itu masih belum juga terbuka."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:72
translate indonesian prologue_start_873b21bf:

    # narrator "Unless you count the neon {b}24H MART{/b} sign across the alley, which flickers bright magenta through my blinds every four seconds like a dying mana crystal."
    narrator "Kecuali kalau plang neon {b}24H MART{/b} di seberang gang bisa dihitung—yang tiap empat detik kedip-kedip ungu terang nembus tirai kamarku kayak kristal mana yang mau habis daya."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:77
translate indonesian prologue_start_48e9ab39:

    # thought "Okay. Let's review the heroism scoreboard at age twenty-six."
    thought "Oke. Mari kita cek rapor kepahlawanan di umur dua puluh enam tahun."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:78
translate indonesian prologue_start_7a6bde71:

    # thought "Dragons slain: zero. Kingdoms liberated: zero. Times today I rehearsed telling my shift supervisor he mispronounced my name for eight months before smiling and saying 'No worries!': three."
    thought "Naga yang dikalahkan: nol. Kerajaan yang diselamatkan: nol. Berapa kali hari ini aku latihan ngomong ke bos sif kalau dia salah nyebut namaku selama delapan bulan, sebelum akhirnya aku cuma senyum dan bilang 'Santai aja, Pak!': tiga kali."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:81
translate indonesian prologue_start_0e060459:

    # narrator "On my folding desk sits a half-price convenience-store curry udon. Cold. Without chopsticks, because the teenaged clerk forgot to toss a pair in the bag and I didn't want to ruin his night by asking."
    narrator "Di atas meja lipatku, ada semangkuk udon kari diskon 50 persen dari minimarket. Udah dingin. Tanpa sumpit pula, gara-gara kasir remajanya lupa masukin ke kantong dan aku nggak enakan buat balik minta."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:82
translate indonesian prologue_start_38ab19b8:

    # narrator "Beside the udon sits a pink rent-adjustment notice, my night-shift moderation headset, and—tucked halfway under the radiator—that same taped-together fourth-grade sketchbook."
    narrator "Di samping mangkuk udon, tergeletak surat merah muda tagihan kenaikan sewa kamar, headset kerja moderasi sif malamku, dan—terselip di kolong radiator—buku gambar kelas empat yang penuh tempelan selotip itu."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:89
translate indonesian prologue_start_ee987769:

    # narrator "I type out: {i}'Doing great! Made stew tonight.'{/i} Stare at the cold convenience-store udon in shame. Delete 'Made stew.' Send: {i}'Doing okay! Raining hard here, stay warm.'{/i}"
    narrator "Kuketuk di layar ponsel: {i}'Kabarku baik banget! Malam ini masak semur daging.'{/i} Kutatap mangkuk udon minimarket yang dingin itu dengan rasa bersalah. Kuhapus 'Masak semur.' Lalu kukirim: {i}'Kabarku baik kok! Di sini lagi hujan deras, jaga kesehatan ya Bu.'{/i}"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:90
translate indonesian prologue_start_62792ddf:

    # thought "Not exactly Arthur pulling Caliburn from the anvil. Still, my chest feels slightly less like wet concrete."
    thought "Jelas nggak sekeren Raja Arthur yang nyabut pedang Caliburn dari batu. Tapi setidaknya, dadaku nggak lagi kerasa sesesak adukan semen basah."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:95
translate indonesian prologue_start_85dfb5bd:

    # narrator "One. Two. Three... By eight, my left shoulder clicks like a rusty stapler. At eleven, the floorboards groan and my downstairs neighbor taps a broom handle against the ceiling."
    narrator "Satu. Dua. Tiga... Pas hitungan kedelapan, bahu kiriku bunyi {i}krek{/i} kayak stapler karatan. Pas hitungan kesebelas, lantai papanku berderit dan tetangga kamar bawah langsung ngetuk-ngetuk langit-langitnya pakai gagang sapu."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:97
translate indonesian prologue_start_03704364:

    # leo "S-sorry! Dropped a dictionary!"
    leo "M-maaf! Nggak sengaja kamusnya jatuh!"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:98
translate indonesian prologue_start_87a514bd:

    # thought "Why did I apologize out loud to a plaster floor? Good lord, Leo."
    thought "Ngapain juga aku minta maaf kenceng-kenceng ke lantai semen? Astaga, Leo, bloon banget sih."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:103
translate indonesian prologue_start_8c473ff0:

    # narrator "The crayon gold on 'Sir Valorian' has faded to mustard yellow. Somewhere around age nineteen, I started using the back pages for grocery math and electric bills."
    narrator "Warna krayon emas 'Sir Valorian' udah pudar jadi kuning kusam. Sejak umur sembilan belas, halaman-halaman belakangnya malah kupakai buat coret-coretan hitung belanjaan dan tagihan listrik."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:104
translate indonesian prologue_start_c52b2285:

    # thought "It's embarrassing how stubbornly a stupid childhood wish hangs on. Like gum on the sole of your last decent pair of sneakers."
    thought "Memalukan banget rasanya, mimpi masa kecil yang konyol ini masih aja nempel keras kepala. Persis permen karet di sol sepatu kets terakhirku yang masih layak pakai."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:106
translate indonesian prologue_start_7d3588b4:

    # narrator "Across the room, my laundry basket overflows with damp hoodies. If I don't dry at least one collared shirt before tomorrow's 9 AM video check-in, I'll look like an unmade bed with eyebags."
    narrator "Di seberang kamar, keranjang cucianku udah tumpah ruah sama cucian hoodie lembap. Kalau nggak ngeringin minimal satu kemeja berkerah buat rapat online jam sembilan pagi besok, mukaku bakal persis kasur acak-acakan yang punya kantung mata."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:107
translate indonesian prologue_start_4e02bf7a:

    # narrator "I slip the battered sketchbook into my coat pocket—purely because the radiator pipe is leaking, obviously, no other reason—grab my last brass dryer token, and head downstairs."
    narrator "Kuselipin buku gambar usang itu ke saku jaketku—cuma gara-gara pipa radiatornya bocor doang ya, beneran nggak ada alasan lain—kusambar koin kuningan terakhir buat mesin pengering, lalu turun ke bawah."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:119
translate indonesian prologue_start_c9e3529d:

    # narrator "2:38 AM. Rain needles the asphalt outside the Eastside Coin Laundry."
    narrator "Jam 02.38 dini hari. Gerimis hujan menusuk-nusuk aspal di depan Laundromat Koin Eastside."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:120
translate indonesian prologue_start_a75c697f:

    # narrator "Inside the steamed window, Dryer #4 tumbles my gray hoodie in hypnotic circles. Forty minutes to kill. Just me, a vending machine humming in B-flat, and a wide rainwater puddle reflecting the streetlamp."
    narrator "Di balik kaca jendela yang berembun, Mesin Pengering #4 mutar-mutar hoodie abu-abuku tanpa henti. Masih ada empat puluh menit nunggu. Cuma ada aku, mesin penjual minuman otomatis yang berdengung pelan, dan genangan air hujan lebar yang mantulin lampu jalan."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:122
translate indonesian prologue_start_338dc462:

    # leo "Someday..."
    leo "Suatu hari nanti..."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:125
translate indonesian prologue_start_c419e701:

    # thought "Did I just whisper 'Someday' at a storm drain? I need vitamins. Or sunlight. Possibly an exorcism."
    thought "Barusan aku beneran ngebisikin 'Suatu hari nanti' ke lubang selokan? Aku beneran butuh vitamin. Atau kena sinar matahari. Kayaknya malah butuh diruqyah sekalian."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:128
translate indonesian prologue_start_9822b5fb:

    # narrator "Wait."
    narrator "Tunggu sebentar."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:129
translate indonesian prologue_start_4fc4e505:

    # narrator "The rain stops hitting the puddle."
    narrator "Tetesan hujan berhenti menyentuh genangan air itu."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:130
translate indonesian prologue_start_32edc1eb:

    # narrator "Not the sidewalk—rain is still drumming on my umbrella and soaking my cuffs—just that six-foot oval of dirty water by the curb. Every droplet striking its surface freezes mid-splash, hanging like glass beads on invisible wire."
    narrator "Bukan di trotoar—hujan masih deras mukul payungku dan ngebahasahin ujung lengan jaket—tapi tepat di genangan air keruh selebar dua meter di pinggir jalan itu. Tiap tetes air yang jatuh ke permukaannya langsung beku di tengah cipratan, menggantung kayak manik-manik kaca di benang transparan."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:132
translate indonesian prologue_start_94cbc385:

    # leo "...Okay. No. Hang on. Let me look left and right."
    leo "...Oke. Nggak, tunggu dulu. Coba nengok kiri-kanan dulu."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:133
translate indonesian prologue_start_34c0eb12:

    # narrator "Empty street. No runaway delivery van. No rogue bakery truck."
    narrator "Jalanan kosong melompong. Nggak ada mobil boks yang lepas kendali. Nggak ada truk roti nyelonong."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:134
translate indonesian prologue_start_680ba0d1:

    # leo "Good. Nobody's getting reincarnated by freight logistics tonight. I'm just sleep-deprived and walking steadily back inside—"
    leo "Bagus. Nggak bakal ada yang kena isekai gara-gara ditabrak truk logistik malam ini. Aku cuma kurang tidur, mending jalan pelan-pelan masuk lagi—"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:141
translate indonesian prologue_start_db94e8da:

    # narrator "The puddle splits open like torn silk, exhaling a gale of bone-dry white salt and ozone!"
    narrator "Genangan itu terbelah bagai kain koyak, menyemburkan badai garam putih kering dan aroma ozon yang menyengat!"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:142
translate indonesian prologue_start_0867775c:

    # narrator "A woman lunges upward out of the upside-down sky inside the asphalt—rain-slicked iron-buckled coat, soot-streaked cheek, wrist wrapped in scarred crystalline veins, clutching a spinning three-ring brass astrolabe that is actively throwing sparks."
    narrator "Seorang cewek menerjang keluar dari langit terbalik di dalam aspal—mantel bergesper besi yang basah kuyup kena hujan, pipi belepotan jelaga, pergelangan tangan terbalut sulur kristal bercahaya, sambil mencengkeram astrolab kuningan bercincin tiga yang berputar kencang memercikkan api!"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:144
translate indonesian prologue_start_4f4eadad:

    # unknown_voice "Ha! Locked the tether! Peak heroic yearning at ninety-eight kelvins—come here, you glorious bastard, before the Concordat—"
    unknown_voice "Hah! Sinyalnya kekunci! Lonjakan hasrat pahlawan pas di sembilan puluh delapan kelvin—sini kau, bocah legendaris, sebelum orang-orang Konkordat—"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:146
translate indonesian prologue_start_6568bcd4:

    # narrator "Her fingers clamp onto the front of my discount windbreaker. For half a second, our eyes meet."
    narrator "Jari-jarinya langsung nyengkeram kerah jaketku. Sedetik kemudian, mata kami saling tatap."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:147
translate indonesian prologue_start_90f739ac:

    # narrator "She looks at my wire-rimmed glasses. My plastic convenience-store bag. My posture."
    narrator "Dia merhatiin kacamata culunku. Kantong kresek minimarket di tanganku. Postur bungkukku."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:148
translate indonesian prologue_start_13358689:

    # narrator "The triumphant grin vanishes from her face like chalk under a hose."
    narrator "Senyum kemenangannya seketika lenyap kayak tulisan kapur disiram air keran."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:150
translate indonesian prologue_start_99f16a4b:

    # unknown_voice "...Wait. Where's your armor?! Why are you holding a fabric-softener sheet?!"
    unknown_voice "...Tunggu. Zirah tempurmu mana?! Kenapa kamu malah megang lembaran pelembut cucian begini?!"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:151
translate indonesian prologue_start_71d00c97:

    # leo "I—excuse me, ma'am, you're standing in a pothole—"
    leo "A—anu, permisi Mbak, Anda lagi berdiri di dalam kubangan jalan..."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:152
translate indonesian prologue_start_6b88d4c0:

    # unknown_voice "Oh, gods damn my cheap solder! The beacon locked onto {i}daydreaming{/i}, not combat mass! Let go of my coat!"
    unknown_voice "Sialan! Gara-gara timah solder murahan nih! Alatnya malah ngunci {i}orang yang lagi bengong melamun{/i}, bukan sosok pendekar! Lepasin mantelku!"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:153
translate indonesian prologue_start_aeb2aba0:

    # leo "YOU'RE HOLDING {i}MY{/i} COAT!"
    leo "SITU YANG NARIK JAKET SAYA DULUAN!"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:154
translate indonesian prologue_start_303c9d40:

    # unknown_voice "Don't breathe through your mouth, shrimp-spine, the salt-shear will peel your tongue!"
    unknown_voice "Jangan mangap, bocah bungkuk! Badai garamnya bisa bikin lidahmu lecet!"

# game/story/prologue.rpy:160
translate indonesian prologue_start_1cee0706:

    # narrator "Gravity inverts."
    narrator "Gravitasi berputar terbalik."

# game/story/prologue.rpy:161
translate indonesian prologue_start_37039b8a:

    # narrator "The neon {b}24H MART{/b} sign stretches into a thin violet thread overhead—and snaps."
    narrator "Plang neon {b}24H MART{/b} di atas memanjang jadi seutas benang ungu tipis—lalu putus seketika."

translate indonesian strings:

    # game/story/prologue.rpy:42
    old "Smooth the torn paper cape carefully onto my knee. \"Someday I'll be strong enough that nobody laughs.\""
    new "Meratakan jubah kertas yang robek itu dengan hati-hati di atas lututku. \"Suatu hari nanti aku akan cukup kuat sampai tak ada lagi yang tertawa.\""

    # game/story/prologue.rpy:47
    old "Count their footsteps and memorize which gate they took so I can walk home the long way."
    new "Menghitung langkah kaki mereka dan mengingat gerbang mana yang mereka lewati supaya aku bisa pulang lewat jalan memutar."

    # game/story/prologue.rpy:52
    old "Stare at a crushed earthworm in the mud and move it onto dry grass under the bench."
    new "Menatap cacing tanah yang tergencet di lumpur, lalu memindahkannya ke rumput kering di bawah bangku."

    # game/story/prologue.rpy:85
    old "Check my phone: an unread text from Mom asking if I'm eating vegetables."
    new "Cek ponsel: ada pesan belum dibaca dari Ibu yang nanyain apakah aku makan sayur."

    # game/story/prologue.rpy:92
    old "Drop down and attempt twenty midnight push-ups to prove I haven't completely given up."
    new "Turun ke lantai dan coba push-up dua puluh kali tengah malam demi buktiin aku belum menyerah."

    # game/story/prologue.rpy:100
    old "Pull the battered hero sketchbook out from under the radiator for a minute."
    new "Narik buku gambar pahlawan yang usang itu dari kolong radiator sebentar."

